---
// Pricing.astro - Transparent Partnership Tiers conforming to DESIGN.md
---

<section id="pricing" class="py-24 bg-white text-[#171A20] scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-[1380px] mx-auto px-6">
    <!-- Header Block -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-[800px] mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-[12px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-[#3E6AE1] uppercase block mb-2">
        Transparent Partnership
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-[32px] md:text-[38px] font-medium leading-[1.2] text-[#171A20] text-balance">
        Predictable Investment. Compounding Growth.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] text-[#5C5E62] leading-[1.6] text-pretty">
        No hidden retainer markups or opaque media commissions. Clear scope, dedicated creative teams, and contractual performance benchmarks.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Tier Cards Grid conforming to DESIGN.md -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-stretch max-w-[1200px] mx-auto">
      <!-- Tier 1: Growth -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-[12px] bg-[#F4F4F4] border border-[#EEEEEE] flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <h3 class="text-[20px] font-medium text-[#171A20]">Growth Tier</h3>
            <span class="text-[12px] font-medium text-[#5C5E62] uppercase tracking-wide">Stage 1</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[14px] text-[#5C5E62] leading-[1.5] mb-6">
            For breakout businesses ready to systematically scale past $50K monthly revenue with structured creative testing.
          </p>

          <div class="mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-[#EEEEEE]">
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
              <span class="text-[36px] font-medium text-[#171A20] tabular-nums">$4,800</span>
              <span class="text-[14px] text-[#5C5E62]">/month</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[12px] text-[#8E8E8E] block mt-1">Recommended ad spend: $10Kâ€“$35K/mo</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="space-y-3 text-[14px] text-[#393C41] mb-8" aria-label="Growth Tier Deliverables">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3E6AE1] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>20 Modular Creative Variations / Mo</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3E6AE1] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>2 Core Platforms (TikTok & Meta)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3E6AE1] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Weekly Algorithmic Bid Optimization</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3E6AE1] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Bi-weekly Growth Strategy Review</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <button
          type="button"
          data-open-audit
          class="btn-secondary w-full justify-center text-[14px] !h-10"
        >
          Select Growth Tier
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Tier 2: Scale Velocity (Featured / Most Popular) -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-[12px] bg-[#171A20] text-white border-2 border-[#3E6AE1] flex flex-col justify-between relative shadow-sm">
        <div class="absolute -top-3.5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-[#3E6AE1] text-white text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-[4px]">
          Most Selected for Scale
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 mt-2">
            <h3 class="text-[20px] font-medium text-white">Scale Velocity</h3>
            <span class="text-[12px] font-medium text-[#3E6AE1] uppercase tracking-wide">Category Leader</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[14px] text-white/70 leading-[1.5] mb-6">
            For market challengers aiming to capture dominant market share with multi-channel creative velocity.
          </p>

          <div class="mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-white/15">
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
              <span class="text-[36px] font-medium text-white tabular-nums">$8,500</span>
              <span class="text-[14px] text-white/60">/month</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[12px] text-white/50 block mt-1">Recommended ad spend: $35Kâ€“$120K/mo</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="space-y-3 text-[14px] text-white/90 mb-8" aria-label="Scale Velocity Tier Deliverables">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3E6AE1] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>45+ Modular Creative Variations / Mo</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3E6AE1] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Full Omnichannel (TikTok, Meta, LinkedIn, X)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3E6AE1] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Creator Seeding & Whitelisted Spark Ads</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3E6AE1] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Daily Bid Tuning & Triple Attribution</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3E6AE1] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Dedicated Creative Director & Video Editor</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <button
          type="button"
          data-open-audit
          class="btn-primary w-full justify-center text-[14px] !h-10"
        >
          Select Scale Velocity
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Tier 3: Enterprise Dominance -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-[12px] bg-[#F4F4F4] border border-[#EEEEEE] flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <h3 class="text-[20px] font-medium text-[#171A20]">Enterprise Dominance</h3>
            <span class="text-[12px] font-medium text-[#5C5E62] uppercase tracking-wide">Monopoly</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[14px] text-[#5C5E62] leading-[1.5] mb-6">
            Complete full channel management for established enterprises and high-growth venture-backed companies.
          </p>

          <div class="mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-[#EEEEEE]">
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
              <span class="text-[36px] font-medium text-[#171A20] tabular-nums">$16,500</span>
              <span class="text-[14px] text-[#5C5E62]">/month</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[12px] text-[#8E8E8E] block mt-1">Recommended ad spend: $120K+/mo</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="space-y-3 text-[14px] text-[#393C41] mb-8" aria-label="Enterprise Dominance Tier Deliverables">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3E6AE1] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Unlimited Creative Iterations & Studio Production</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3E6AE1] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Executive & C-Suite Personal Brand Scaling</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3E6AE1] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Dedicated 5-Person In-House Growth Squad</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3E6AE1] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              <span>24/7 Priority Slack Connect Channel</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <button
          type="button"
          data-open-audit
          class="btn-secondary w-full justify-center text-[14px] !h-10"
        >
          Contact Enterprise Desk
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Performance Guarantee Banner -->
    <div class="mt-16 p-8 rounded-[8px] bg-[#F4F4F4] border border-[#EEEEEE] max-w-[1000px] mx-auto text-center">
      <h4 class="text-[18px] font-medium text-[#171A20] mb-2">
        The GrovexMedia Performance Benchmark Guarantee
      </h4>
      <p class="text-[14px] text-[#5C5E62] leading-[1.6] max-w-[760px] mx-auto">
        If our agreed ROAS or acquisition volume benchmarks are not achieved within the first 60 days of campaign deployment, our agency management fee is 100% waived until the performance targets are met. Zero lock-in contracts.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

